16 ! number of processors per mpi thread
6e-12 ! initial minimum time step
2e-4 ! max total integration time
1e-5 1e-5 ! acceptance relative residual in domain in voltage and density of first particle
20 ! maximum number of iterations
test ! save file name
../../../test_SC/ ! Save directory relative path
no ! Restart(yes/no) and save directory to take from
END

